This project ships no BIOS files, games, ROMs or keys.

Third-party components
----------------------
The app includes the following components. Each keeps its own license.

PCSX2 (upstream/pcsx2), the emulation core
    GPL-3.0-or-later, PCSX2 Dev Team. Our changes are in upstream/patches.
    The libraries PCSX2 bundles are in upstream/pcsx2/3rdparty, each with its
    license file.

Libraries built by android/deps/build-deps.sh and shipped in the APK
    libjpeg-turbo   IJG AND BSD-3-Clause AND Zlib
    libpng          libpng-2.0 (with the APNG patch)
    libwebp         BSD-3-Clause
    LZ4             BSD-2-Clause
    Zstandard       BSD-3-Clause OR GPL-2.0-only
    FreeType        FTL OR GPL-2.0-or-later
    SDL             Zlib
    PlutoVG         MIT
    PlutoSVG        MIT
    RapidYAML       MIT
    shaderc         Apache-2.0, with glslang (BSD-3-Clause and others),
                    SPIRV-Tools (Apache-2.0) and SPIRV-Headers (MIT)

Fonts shipped with the core's resources
    Roboto, Roboto Mono     Apache-2.0
    Font Awesome Free       OFL-1.1
    PromptFont              OFL-1.1

Data
    The list of known good BIOS dumps (android/app/src/main/assets/
    known-bios.txt) comes from the redump.org datfile "Sony - PlayStation 2 -
    BIOS Images". It contains hashes only, no BIOS data.
